  "3. Hazard topics & thresholds": "3. 灾害主题与阈值",
  "A continuous pixel-based hazard score is derived by combining the normalised intensity values across all hazard layers, integrating both the breadth and severity of co-occurring hazards. The user selects a global percentile threshold (e.g. P90); only pixels whose score exceeds that percentile are highlighted on the map.": "通过综合所有灾害图层的归一化强度值，得出基于像元的连续灾害评分，同时反映并发灾害的广度和严重程度。用户选择一个全球百分位阈值（如 P90）；地图上仅突出显示评分超过该百分位的像元。",
  "A fluvial or riverine flood is a rise, usually brief, in the water level of a stream or water body to a peak from which the water level recedes at a slower rate.": "河流洪水是指河流或水体水位通常短暂地上涨至峰值，随后以较慢速度回落的现象。",
  "A heatwave can be defined as a period where local excess heat accumulates over a sequence of unusually hot days and nights. Heatwave duration refers to the total number of days an event lasts.": "热浪可定义为在一系列异常炎热的昼夜中局地过量热量不断累积的时期。热浪持续时间是指一次事件持续的总天数。",
  "A heatwave can be defined as a period where local excess heat accumulates over a sequence of unusually hot days and nights. Heatwave frequency refers to the number of heatwaves per year.": "热浪可定义为在一系列异常炎热的昼夜中局地过量热量不断累积的时期。热浪频率是指每年发生热浪的次数。",
  "A heatwave can be defined as a period where local excess heat accumulates over a sequence of unusually hot days and nights. Heatwave severity refers to the temperature above the local 15-day average during the heatwave, expressed in degrees Celsius.": "热浪可定义为在一系列异常炎热的昼夜中局地过量热量不断累积的时期。热浪强度是指热浪期间高于当地 15 天平均气温的温度，以摄氏度表示。",
  "A tropical storm is a type of storm system characterized by a low-pressure center, a closed low-level atmospheric circulation, strong winds, and a spiral arrangement of thunderstorms that produce heavy rain.": "热带风暴是一种风暴系统，其特征包括低压中心、封闭的低层大气环流、强风以及呈螺旋状分布并带来强降雨的雷暴。",
