  "Agricultural Stress Index (%)": "农业胁迫指数（%）",
  "Agricultural drought occurs when there is insufficient soil moisture to meet the needs of a particular crop at a particular time.": "当土壤水分不足以满足特定作物在特定时期的需求时，即发生农业干旱。",
  "Air Pollution": "空气污染",
  "Air pollution refers to the presence of substances in the atmosphere that are harmful to human health and the environment. Fine particle air pollution (PM2.5) refers to airborne particles measuring less than 2.5 micrometers in diameter emitted from vehicles, fuel use, power plants, agriculture, waste burning, wildfires, and other sources.": "空气污染是指大气中存在对人类健康和环境有害的物质。细颗粒物空气污染（PM2.5）是指由车辆、燃料使用、发电厂、农业、垃圾焚烧、野火及其他来源排放的直径小于 2.5 微米的空气颗粒物。",
  "All ages": "所有年龄",
