  "Climate hazards are selected by default. Add or remove topics, and adjust any hazard's threshold below.": "默认选择气候灾害。可在下方添加或移除主题，并调整任一灾害的阈值。",
  "Coastal Flood": "沿海洪水",
  "Coastal flooding is most frequently the result of storm surges and high winds coinciding with high tides.": "沿海洪水最常见的成因是风暴潮和大风与高潮位同时发生。",
  "Combined count of climate hazard types exceeding their respective thresholds at each pixel. Includes 8 climate topics: River Flood, Coastal Flood, Tropical Storm, Drought, Heatwave, Extreme Heat, Fire, and Sand and Dust Storm. Climate-related topics (Air Pollution, Malaria) and geophysical hazards (Landslide, Earthquake, Volcanoes) are excluded.": "每个像元上超过各自阈值的气候灾害类型的综合计数。包括 8 个气候主题：河流洪水、沿海洪水、热带风暴、干旱、热浪、极端高温、火灾以及沙尘暴。不包括气候相关主题（空气污染、疟疾）和地球物理灾害（滑坡、地震、火山）。",
  "Combined hazard count and intensity score across all hazard types.": "涵盖所有灾害类型的灾害数量与强度综合评分。",
