  "Figures are the modelled child population in areas where the hazard exceeds the stated threshold — indicative of relative exposure, not observed impacts.": "数据为灾害超过所述阈值区域内的模拟儿童人口——反映相对暴露程度，而非观测到的影响。",
  "Figures shown are {modelled}, derived from global hazard datasets combined with WorldPop gridded population. They indicate relative exposure — not observed impacts — and carry uncertainty that increases at finer administrative levels.": "所示数据为{modelled}，由全球灾害数据集结合 WorldPop 格网化人口得出。数据反映相对暴露程度（而非观测到的影响），且存在不确定性，行政级别越细，不确定性越大。",
