  "For topics with multiple hazard layers (e.g. Drought combines agricultural and meteorological drought), hazard coverage is first computed independently for each layer at its own threshold. An OR union is then applied across layers to derive the combined topic footprint, which is subsequently overlaid with the WorldPop under-18 grid to estimate the number of children exposed.": "对于包含多个灾害图层的主题（如干旱综合了农业干旱和气象干旱），首先按各图层自身阈值独立计算灾害覆盖范围，然后对各图层进行“或”合并，得出该主题的综合范围，再将其与 WorldPop 18 岁以下人口格网叠加，以估算暴露儿童人数。",
