  "Proximity to holocene volcanoes (active since 1800) within a 100 km buffer. The Global Volcanism Program (GVP) database is a comprehensive record of volcanic activity and related phenomena worldwide.": "距全新世火山（1800 年以来活动）100 公里缓冲区内的邻近程度。全球火山活动计划（GVP）数据库全面记录了全球火山活动及相关现象。",
  "Rainfall-triggered landslide hazard based on the GFDRR Global Landslide Hazard Map (V2), representing the annual frequency of significant rainfall-induced landslides per km².": "基于 GFDRR 全球滑坡灾害图（V2）的降雨诱发滑坡灾害，表示每平方公里重大降雨诱发滑坡的年发生频率。",
